OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after child injured in
OL,4,Aalleged hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fyoung child was seriously injured in an
OL,8,Falleged hit-and-run incident in
OL,9,FCambridgeshire.
OL,11,FThe boy was riding his bicycle to
OL,12,Fprimary school when he was hit by a
OL,13,Fgrey Citroen Picasso at about 08:35 GMT
OL,14,Fin Townsend, Soham.
OL,16,FHis injuries were said to be serious,
OL,17,Fbut not life-threatening, and his
OL,18,Fmother, who was walking with him,
OL,19,Fsuffered minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
