OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after child injured in
OL,4,Aalleged hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 19 and 29, from Soham,
OL,7,Fallegedly left the car at the scene but
OL,8,Fwere later arrested in connection with
OL,9,Fthe incident.
